{"at": "2026-09-25T05:36:27.654710+00:00", "event_id": "01M3BH19G6M6NHRB6D2NHTX7Y5", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3BGRBWBDWG3F3EEA4Z5S8VQ", "final_answer": "Advancing next must agree with query mode: dispatch the actionable WP (e.g. implement WP01 for a rejected WP that fell to planned, or a coord WP the primary dir cannot see); return kind=blocked with a named recovery command ONLY when the board has no actionable WP. Never emit the WP-less composition placeholder as a live advancing loop state.", "mission_id": "01M3BGQ07M22KCP9XTCWSNH080", "mission_slug": "advancing-next-board-unification-01M3BGQ0", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-25T05:36:27.654710Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3BGRBWBDWG3F3EEA4Z5S8VQ", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-25T05:36:27.647093Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
